        "id": 43,
        "title": "Andy Taylor, guitarist in Duran Duran, dies aged 65",
        "source": "The Guardian - Culture",
        "source_id": "guardian_culture",
        "category": "culture",
        "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/nov/25/andy-taylor-duran-duran-guitarist-dead",
        "published_at": "2026-11-25T21:41:34",
        "level": "B2",
        "slot_level": "B2",
        "source_level": "B2",
        "word_count": 1060,
        "duration_sec": null,
        "body_text": "Andy Taylor, the guitarist with 80s pop megastars Duran Duran, has died aged 65. He had been diagnosed with stage four metastatic prostate cancer in 2018, which he disclosed publicly in 2022 when Duran Duran were about to be inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame.",
        "audio_url": null,
        "description": null,
        "license": "proprietary",
        "attribution": null,
        "truncated": true,
        "guid_hash": "604b7496c241926bac3a78288375045e629adb38",
        "summary": "Musician who had huge 1980s chart success had been diagnosed with prostate cancer in 2018 Duran Duran was transformed by Andy Taylor’s rock edge – and never quite the same without him Andy Taylor – a life in pictures Andy Taylor, the guitarist with 80s pop megastars Duran Duran, has died aged 65. He had been diagnosed with stage four metastatic prostate cancer in 2018, which he disclosed publicly in 2022 when Duran Duran were about to be inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame.",
